msgid "I2P+ installation complete!"
msgstr "Usakinishaji wa I2P+ umekamilika!"

msgid "Welcome to I2P+!"
msgstr "Karibu I2P+!"

#, java-format
msgid "Please {0}have patience{1} as I2P+ boots up and finds peers."
msgstr "Tafadhali {0}na subira{1} wakati I2P+ inaanza na kutafuta peer."

#, java-format
msgid "While you are waiting, please {0}adjust your bandwidth settings{1} on the {2}configuration page{3}."
msgstr "Wakati mnasubiri, tafadhali {0}badilisha mipangilio yenu ya kasi{1} kwenye {2}kurasa ya mipangilio{3}."

#, java-format
msgid "You can also run the bandwidth test via the {0}Setup Wizard{1} to help with determining your bandwidth, and a guide for new users and additional documentation including an FAQ is available in the {2}help section{1}."
msgstr "Mnaweza pia kuendesha jaribio la kasi kupitia {0}Mwongoza wa Mpangilio{1} ili kusaidia kubaini kasi yenu, na mwongozo kwa watumiaji wapya na nyaraka zaidi ikiwa ni pamoja na Maswali Yanayoulizwa Mara kwa Mara, zipo katika {2}sekshen ya msaada{1}."

#, java-format
msgid "You may also wish to enable I2P+ updates on {0}the update configuration page{1}."
msgstr "Mnapenda pia kuwasha sasisho za I2P+ kwenye {0}kurasa ya mipangilio ya sasisho{1}."

msgid "Also you can setup your browser to use the I2P proxy to reach eepsites."
msgstr "Pia mnaweza kusanidi kivinjari chenu kutumia proksi ya I2P ili kufikia eepsites."

msgid "Just enter 127.0.0.1 (or localhost) port 4444 as a http proxy into your browser settings."
msgstr "Ingiza tu 127.0.0.1 (au localhost) bandari 4444 kama proksi ya http katika mipangilio ya kivinjari chenu."

msgid "Do not use SOCKS for this."
msgstr "Usitumie SOCKS kwa hili."

#, java-format
msgid "More information can be found on the {0}I2P browser proxy setup page{1}."
msgstr "Taarifa zaidi zinaweza kupatikana kwenye {0}kurasa ya mipangilio ya proksi ya kivinjari ya I2P{1}."

#, java-format
msgid "Point your IRC client to {0}localhost:6668{1} and say hi to us on {2}#saltR{3}."
msgstr "Elekeza mteja wenu wa IRC kwenye {0}localhost:6668{1} na sema hello kwetu kwenye {2}#saltR{3}."
